WEBVTT

00:00.990 --> 00:06.930
Zankoku na tenshi no you ni

00:00.990 --> 00:06.930
Just like the cruel angel

00:06.930 --> 00:14.590
Shounen yo shinwa ni nare

00:06.930 --> 00:14.590
Young boy, become a legend

00:18.990 --> 00:22.410
2D4U PRESENTS:

00:22.770 --> 00:25.810
Aoi kaze ga ima

00:22.770 --> 00:25.810
Even though the untested breeze...

00:25.810 --> 00:29.510
mune no doa o tataitemo

00:25.810 --> 00:29.510
...taps at the door to your heart

00:29.510 --> 00:36.970
Watashi dake o tada mitsumete hohoenderu anata

00:29.510 --> 00:36.970
You just look solely at me and smile

00:37.560 --> 00:44.500
Sotto fureru mono motomeru koto ni muchuu de

00:37.560 --> 00:44.500
So intent on seeking out that gentle touch

00:44.500 --> 00:51.400
Unmei sae mada shiranai itaike na hitomi

00:44.500 --> 00:51.400
Such innocent eyes, still ignorant of their destiny

00:52.000 --> 00:55.750
Dakedo itsuka kizuku deshou

00:52.000 --> 00:55.750
But someday, you are sure to realize...

00:55.750 --> 00:58.340
sono senaka ni wa

00:55.750 --> 00:58.340
...that upon your back

00:59.510 --> 01:02.960
Haruka mirai mezasu tame

00:59.510 --> 01:02.960
You have the wings with which to fly...

01:02.960 --> 01:06.310
no hane ga aru koto

01:02.960 --> 01:06.310
...towards the distant future

01:06.990 --> 01:10.690
Zankoku na tenshi no teeze

01:06.990 --> 01:10.690
The cruel angel's thesis

01:10.690 --> 01:14.430
Madobe kara yagate tobidatsu

01:10.690 --> 01:14.430
Soon, you will take flight from the windowsill

01:14.430 --> 01:18.200
Hotobashiru atsui patosu de

01:14.430 --> 01:18.200
With your torrent of ardent pathos

01:18.200 --> 01:21.900
Omoide o uragiru nara

01:18.200 --> 01:21.900
If you are to betray our memories

01:21.900 --> 01:25.540
Kono sora o daite kagayaku

01:21.900 --> 01:25.540
You, who embrace these heavens and shine

01:25.540 --> 01:29.270
Shounen yo shinwa ni nare

01:25.540 --> 01:29.270
Young boy, become a legend

01:30.400 --> 01:32.780
The year is 2015 A.D.

01:54.800 --> 01:59.000
As of 12:30 PM today, a special state
of emergency has been declared

01:59.000 --> 02:03.460
for the Kanto and Chubu regions
surrounding the Tokai district.

02:03.460 --> 02:07.770
All residents must evacuate to their
designated shelters immediately.

02:07.770 --> 02:12.510
Repeating: As of 12:30 PM today,

02:11.650 --> 02:14.070
All Lines Stopped

02:12.510 --> 02:16.330
the Kanto and Chubu regions
surrounding the Tokai district

02:16.330 --> 02:19.300
have been declared to be under
a state of emergency.

02:19.300 --> 02:20.750
All residents must evacuate...

02:20.750 --> 02:24.190
Why did I have to lose sight of him now?

02:24.190 --> 02:26.120
Oh, man!

02:26.160 --> 02:28.750
Shinji Ikari

02:26.880 --> 02:29.840
Due to the special emergency,

02:29.840 --> 02:33.500
all lines are currently unavailable.

02:34.470 --> 02:35.300
It's no use.

02:36.410 --> 02:39.050
I shouldn't have come here after all.

02:42.850 --> 02:45.260
To Shinji
I'll be coming to get you,
so wait for me.
Attention here please!!

02:43.100 --> 02:45.260
Well, I guess we won't be meeting here.

02:46.460 --> 02:49.230
Can't be helped. I'll go to a shelter.

03:14.630 --> 03:18.550
Estimated Path

03:14.630 --> 03:18.550
The unidentified mobile object is still
advancing on our position.

03:19.070 --> 03:22.430
We've got visual confirmation.
I'm putting it on the main screen.

03:23.910 --> 03:25.730
It's been fifteen years, hasn't it?

03:25.730 --> 03:27.840
Yes, there's no doubt.

03:28.940 --> 03:30.480
It's an Angel.

03:30.520 --> 03:33.190
EPISODE ONE
ANGEL ATTACK

03:42.280 --> 03:44.170
Every missile hit the target!

04:03.290 --> 04:04.890
I'm sorry! Thanks for waiting!

04:21.850 --> 04:26.480
The target is still operational.
It's still heading towards New Tokyo-3.

04:26.480 --> 04:29.370
The Air Defense Force doesn't have
the firepower to stop it!

04:29.800 --> 04:31.110
Hit it with everything we've got!

04:31.110 --> 04:33.150
Mobilize all of Atsugi and Iruma as well!

04:33.150 --> 04:36.330
Don't hold anything back!
Destroy the target at any cost!

04:49.600 --> 04:52.430
Why?! That was a direct hit!

04:52.430 --> 04:54.340
The tank battalion's been annihilated.

04:54.850 --> 04:57.890
Guided missiles and artillery
have no effect either.

04:57.890 --> 05:01.110
It's no good! We'll never get anywhere
with the firepower we've got!

05:01.110 --> 05:03.320
Is it an AT field after all?

05:03.320 --> 05:06.860
Yes. Conventional weapons are
useless against Angels.

05:10.570 --> 05:13.500
I understand. We'll activate it as planned.

05:18.420 --> 05:20.050
Hey, don't tell me...

05:20.050 --> 05:21.750
They're going to use an N2 mine?!

05:22.380 --> 05:23.630
Get down!

05:46.280 --> 05:46.990
We did it!

05:48.640 --> 05:51.530
Sorry, but it looks like you won't be
getting a shot at it.

05:52.040 --> 05:53.860
Shock wave approaching.

05:55.010 --> 05:56.520
Are you all right?

05:56.520 --> 05:59.940
Yeah, but my mouth is full of dirt.

05:59.940 --> 06:04.090
That's okay. Now then, here we go!

06:04.430 --> 06:06.180
One, two!

06:13.010 --> 06:14.130
There.

06:14.450 --> 06:16.740
Thanks for the hand. I really appreciate it.

06:16.740 --> 06:19.880
Thank you too, Miss Katsuragi.

06:19.880 --> 06:21.840
Just Misato is fine.

06:22.370 --> 06:26.060
I'm glad we've met at last, Shinji Ikari.

06:26.060 --> 06:27.190
Yeah...

06:27.190 --> 06:28.870
What's the target's status?

06:28.870 --> 06:31.320
We're unable to confirm due to
all the EMP interference.

06:31.710 --> 06:34.240
You saw the size of the explosion. It's over.

06:34.620 --> 06:36.240
Sensors restored.

06:37.130 --> 06:39.080
We've got an energy reading
at the explosion's epicenter!

06:39.080 --> 06:40.080
What the hell?!

06:40.510 --> 06:42.230
Visual display restored.

06:46.330 --> 06:48.310
That was our last resort.

06:49.350 --> 06:51.320
How can this be?

06:51.320 --> 06:52.920
Damned monster!

07:02.810 --> 07:05.440
Yes. Don't worry about it.

07:05.440 --> 07:09.680
His safety is my top priority,
so could you get a car train ready for us?

07:09.680 --> 07:10.820
A direct one.

07:11.490 --> 07:12.470
Right.

07:12.860 --> 07:15.380
Well, I volunteered to pick him up,

07:15.380 --> 07:17.670
so I'll make sure he gets there. See ya!

07:20.340 --> 07:27.260
<i>Man, this sucks! I just had my car restored
and it's a total wreck already!</i>

07:27.260 --> 07:30.710
<i>33 more loan payments to go,
plus the cost of repairs.</i>

07:30.710 --> 07:33.010
<i>And look! My best dress has been ruined!</i>

07:33.010 --> 07:34.750
Um, Miss Misato...

07:33.500 --> 07:36.380
<i>And I was looking and feeling so nice.</i>

07:37.270 --> 07:38.970
Excuse me, Misato?

07:39.400 --> 07:40.550
What?

07:40.550 --> 07:43.350
Are you sure you can just take those?

07:44.770 --> 07:46.340
Never mind about that!

07:46.340 --> 07:49.650
It's an emergency, and we need
a working car right now, right?

07:49.650 --> 07:53.380
And I'm an international government
official, after all,

07:53.380 --> 07:55.110
so everything's going to be
perfectly fine, okay?

07:56.150 --> 07:58.790
I don't think anyone will buy that.

07:58.790 --> 08:03.290
You're no fun. You look cute,
but you're kind of a cold fish.

08:04.080 --> 08:05.460
You think so?

08:05.460 --> 08:06.840
Oh, did I upset you?

08:08.010 --> 08:11.490
Sorry about that! You are a boy, after all.

08:11.490 --> 08:14.180
And you're pretty childish for your age.

08:20.610 --> 08:23.370
As we predicted, it's regenerating itself.

08:23.950 --> 08:27.360
If it couldn't, it wouldn't be
a practical autonomous weapon.

08:31.310 --> 08:34.860
Impressive. It appears it can even upgrade
its own operational functions.

08:35.290 --> 08:37.320
And it seems to have gotten smarter.

08:38.530 --> 08:41.370
It's only a matter of time before
it resumes attacking.

08:42.760 --> 08:46.120
The gates are now closing.
Please stand clear.

08:46.120 --> 08:48.030
The special duty organization Nerv?

08:46.120 --> 08:48.420
Now departing.

08:48.030 --> 08:51.660
Yes, it's a secret organization under
the control of the United Nations.

08:48.420 --> 08:56.590
This is the C-22 Special Express
departing directly for G33-1.

08:51.660 --> 08:53.400
That's where my father is, right?

08:53.400 --> 08:54.400
Well, yeah.

08:54.400 --> 08:56.590
Do you know what he does?

08:57.600 --> 09:02.120
This train will bypass all other stations.
Please stand back.

09:00.460 --> 09:04.520
My teacher told me his work is vital
for the protection of the human race.

09:07.430 --> 09:10.760
From this point forward, command of this
operation will be entrusted to you.

09:10.760 --> 09:12.560
Show us what you're capable of.

09:12.560 --> 09:13.990
Yes, Sir.

09:13.990 --> 09:20.460
Ikari, we will admit that our weapons
have no effect on the target.

09:21.080 --> 09:23.120
But are you sure you can beat this thing?

09:24.020 --> 09:25.850
It's what Nerv was created for.

09:26.400 --> 09:27.940
Let's hope you're correct.

09:29.520 --> 09:31.910
The target is still stationary.

09:31.910 --> 09:35.420
Our intercept system is currently
7.5% operational.

09:36.890 --> 09:39.200
So, even the UN forces have retired.

09:39.200 --> 09:40.390
What are you going to do?

09:41.180 --> 09:43.050
I intend to activate Unit 01.

09:43.480 --> 09:46.640
Unit 01? But we have no pilot.

09:47.280 --> 09:50.860
That's not a problem. Another spare
will be delivered soon.

09:51.790 --> 09:54.280
Are you taking me to my father?

09:55.090 --> 09:56.950
Yes. Pretty much.

10:01.000 --> 10:02.080
Father...

10:03.930 --> 10:07.340
Oh, that's right. Did you get
an ID card from your father?

10:09.040 --> 10:10.550
Yes.

10:11.990 --> 10:12.930
Here it is.

10:12.930 --> 10:13.880
Thanks.

10:13.880 --> 10:15.130
Come.
Gendo Ikari

10:15.590 --> 10:18.090
Then read this.

10:18.090 --> 10:19.760
Welcome to Nerv

10:18.640 --> 10:19.760
Nerv...

10:20.810 --> 10:22.460
My father's agency.

10:22.850 --> 10:24.810
Am I going to work for them too?

10:26.890 --> 10:28.590
Of course.

10:28.590 --> 10:33.010
He wouldn't have sent me a letter unless
he needed me for something.

10:33.010 --> 10:36.440
I see. So you don't get along with your father.

10:37.440 --> 10:39.080
It's the same with me.

10:45.040 --> 10:46.660
Awesome!

10:47.500 --> 10:49.380
It's a real Geo-Front!

10:49.380 --> 10:50.220
That's right.

10:50.220 --> 10:53.380
This is our secret base.
Nerv Headquarters.

10:54.050 --> 10:55.950
This is the key to rebuilding our world.

10:55.950 --> 10:58.540
A fortress for all mankind.

11:05.290 --> 11:10.130
That's strange. Isn't this the right way?

11:12.200 --> 11:15.360
This is why I hate wearing skirts here.

11:15.360 --> 11:18.750
But where the heck did Ritsuko go?

11:18.750 --> 11:21.290
I'm sorry. I'm just not used to this place yet.

11:21.290 --> 11:23.230
We passed this spot just a little while ago.

11:24.960 --> 11:26.450
But don't worry about it.

11:26.450 --> 11:29.080
They make these systems
to be used, you know.

11:29.080 --> 11:32.050
Would the head of Project E,
Technical Department Division 1,

11:32.050 --> 11:34.920
Dr. Ritsuko Akagi, Dr. Ritsuko Akagi,

11:34.920 --> 11:39.680
please contact Captain Misato Katsuragi
of Operations, Division 1, immediately.

11:39.680 --> 11:41.310
I don't believe it.

11:41.310 --> 11:42.300
She got lost again, didn't she?

11:47.000 --> 11:48.720
Uh, hiya, Ritsuko.

11:53.910 --> 11:56.350
What were you doing, Captain Katsuragi?

11:56.350 --> 11:58.360
We're short on both time
and manpower, you know.

11:58.360 --> 11:59.480
Sorry!

12:03.210 --> 12:05.160
So this is the boy?

12:05.160 --> 12:09.310
Right. According to the Marduk report,
he's the Third Child.

12:09.640 --> 12:11.100
I'm glad to meet you.

12:11.100 --> 12:12.830
Huh? Sure.

12:12.830 --> 12:17.840
He's just like his father.
Like how he's unendearing.

12:17.840 --> 12:19.440
I'll leave the rest to you.

12:23.920 --> 12:26.390
Their first meeting in over three years.

12:27.190 --> 12:31.050
Vice Commander, the target
has started moving again.

12:31.050 --> 12:34.230
Right. All personnel, assume
battle stations, Level One.

12:34.230 --> 12:38.030
Repeat. All personnel, assume
battle stations, Level One.

12:38.030 --> 12:39.540
Prepare for ground-unit interception.

12:39.540 --> 12:40.950
Here we go.

12:40.950 --> 12:42.570
It sounds pretty serious.

12:43.120 --> 12:45.470
So, how's Unit 01 doing?

12:45.470 --> 12:47.820
It's currently in refrigeration,
using the B-type equipment.

12:47.820 --> 12:51.820
Does it really work?
It's never worked before, right?

12:51.820 --> 12:57.230
The possibility of activation is 0.000000001%.

12:57.230 --> 12:59.830
We call it, pathetically enough,
the O-9 System.

12:59.830 --> 13:02.540
Does that mean it doesn't work?

13:02.540 --> 13:05.120
Oh, don't be insulting. It's not zero.

13:05.120 --> 13:06.950
Well, it's just a number.

13:06.950 --> 13:11.560
Anyway, it's a bit too late to be saying,
"Sorry, it didn't work".

13:20.010 --> 13:23.140
Huh? It's completely dark.

13:26.350 --> 13:29.350
A face? A giant robot?

13:30.820 --> 13:33.220
You won't find this in the manual.

13:33.810 --> 13:38.080
This is mankind's ultimate
multipurpose decisive weapon,

13:38.080 --> 13:41.500
the synthetic human Evangelion, Unit 01.

13:41.500 --> 13:47.030
Built in absolute secrecy,
it is mankind's trump card.

13:47.030 --> 13:49.130
Is this part of what my father's been doing?

13:49.130 --> 13:50.190
Correct.

13:51.940 --> 13:53.010
It's been a while.

13:54.510 --> 13:55.880
Father...

13:58.380 --> 13:59.820
We're moving out!

13:59.820 --> 14:03.680
Moving out?! Unit 00's still in
cryo-stasis, isn't it?

14:05.170 --> 14:08.100
You're not planning to use Unit 01?!

14:08.100 --> 14:09.790
There's no other way.

14:09.790 --> 14:13.030
Hold on! Rei can't do it yet, can she?

14:13.530 --> 14:14.950
We've got no pilot!

14:15.910 --> 14:17.080
One's just been delivered.

14:18.220 --> 14:19.460
Are you serious?

14:20.280 --> 14:21.490
Shinji Ikari...

14:21.490 --> 14:22.450
Yes?

14:22.450 --> 14:23.630
You will pilot it.

14:24.340 --> 14:29.640
But even Rei Ayanami took seven months
to synchronize with her Eva.

14:29.640 --> 14:32.350
It's impossible for him to do it!
He just got here!

14:32.350 --> 14:35.210
He just has to sit in the seat.
We don't expect more than that.

14:35.210 --> 14:36.240
But...

14:36.240 --> 14:38.730
Repelling that Angel is our ultimate priority.

14:38.730 --> 14:43.020
To do that, we have no choice but to put
aboard the Eva whomever has the chance

14:43.020 --> 14:45.650
to synchronize with it, no matter how slight.

14:46.570 --> 14:49.030
I believe you know that, Captain Katsuragi.

14:51.100 --> 14:52.800
I suppose...

14:53.890 --> 14:56.430
Father, why did you send for me?

14:56.430 --> 14:58.620
You know exactly why.

14:58.620 --> 15:02.750
So, you're asking me to take this thing
and fight that thing?

15:03.140 --> 15:03.920
That's right.

15:03.920 --> 15:07.880
No way! Why are you doing this now?!

15:07.880 --> 15:10.530
I thought you didn't need me!

15:10.530 --> 15:12.660
I called you because I have a need for you.

15:15.060 --> 15:17.040
Why me?

15:17.040 --> 15:19.560
Because no one else can.

15:20.000 --> 15:22.260
No, I can't...

15:22.260 --> 15:26.230
I've never even seen anything
like this before! I can't do this!

15:26.750 --> 15:28.150
You will be instructed.

15:28.840 --> 15:33.080
But there's no way I can do this!

15:33.500 --> 15:35.490
I can't pilot it!

15:37.010 --> 15:40.370
If you're going to pilot it, do it now
and quickly. If not, leave!

15:51.600 --> 15:54.010
It must have detected our location.

15:57.880 --> 16:00.030
Shinji, we don't have time.

16:04.810 --> 16:05.650
Get into it.

16:07.120 --> 16:11.740
No! I didn't come for this! This isn't fair!

16:13.020 --> 16:16.490
Shinji, just why did you come here?

16:18.230 --> 16:22.660
You mustn't run! Not from your father,
and most of all not from yourself.

16:23.100 --> 16:27.590
I know that! But there's no way I can do it!

16:35.290 --> 16:36.090
Fuyutsuki...

16:37.630 --> 16:39.070
Wake up Rei.

16:39.070 --> 16:40.480
Can we use her?

16:40.480 --> 16:42.510
She isn't dead.

16:43.410 --> 16:44.660
I understand.

16:46.240 --> 16:47.010
Rei.

16:47.010 --> 16:48.050
Yes?

16:48.050 --> 16:51.170
Our spare is unusable. You will do it again.

16:51.170 --> 16:51.900
Yes, Sir.

16:54.270 --> 16:57.450
Reconfigure Unit 01's system to Rei,
then re-activate!

16:57.450 --> 17:01.190
Roger. Call off the present work,
and begin re-activation.

17:02.700 --> 17:07.040
I knew it. I'm not needed after all.

17:40.400 --> 17:41.030
Watch out!

17:51.280 --> 17:52.970
The Eva moved!

17:52.970 --> 17:54.040
What's going on?!

17:54.040 --> 17:56.130
It broke the right arm restraint!

17:56.130 --> 17:58.300
No, that's impossible!

17:58.300 --> 18:00.300
It didn't even have an entry plug inserted!

18:00.300 --> 18:01.640
There's no way it could have moved!

18:02.850 --> 18:05.780
It reacted without any interface?!

18:05.780 --> 18:08.100
Or was it protecting...

18:08.100 --> 18:08.940
him?

18:10.310 --> 18:11.190
We can do it.

18:32.240 --> 18:37.010
I mustn't run away. I mustn't run away.
I mustn't run away.

18:37.010 --> 18:38.260
I mustn't run away!

18:39.730 --> 18:41.150
I'll do it.

18:41.150 --> 18:42.180
I'll pilot it!

18:45.790 --> 18:47.250
Cooling process, completed.

18:47.250 --> 18:48.760
Right arm re-secured.

18:48.760 --> 18:50.820
Cage contents now in position for docking.

18:50.820 --> 18:51.500
Roger.

18:51.500 --> 18:54.440
Signal terminator plug has been ejected.

18:55.010 --> 18:57.530
Roger. Inserting entry plug.

18:57.530 --> 19:01.080
Direct hydro-transmission system,
connection prepared.

19:04.690 --> 19:06.360
Plug fixed in place.

19:06.360 --> 19:08.160
First stage connection initiated.

19:12.900 --> 19:15.130
Filling the entry plug.

19:15.890 --> 19:17.130
What is this stuff?

19:21.200 --> 19:24.360
Don't worry. Once your lungs
are filled with LCL,

19:24.360 --> 19:27.000
your blood will be oxygenated directly.

19:27.000 --> 19:28.490
You'll get used to it.

19:31.660 --> 19:33.060
I feel nauseous.

19:33.060 --> 19:35.310
Stop whining! You're a boy, aren't you?!

19:36.780 --> 19:38.050
Connecting main power.

19:38.050 --> 19:40.710
All circuits transmitting power.

19:40.710 --> 19:41.520
Roger.

19:41.520 --> 19:43.320
Commencing secondary contacts.

19:44.620 --> 19:47.180
A-10 nerve connection, normal.

19:49.150 --> 19:52.770
Set the thought configuration to Japanese.

19:53.130 --> 19:55.740
All preliminary contacts established.
Performance nominal.

19:55.740 --> 19:57.630
Bi-directional circuits are open.

19:57.630 --> 20:00.720
Synchronization rate at 41.3%.

20:00.720 --> 20:02.460
Amazing.

20:02.460 --> 20:06.410
Harmonics are all normal.
No disturbances identified.

20:06.710 --> 20:07.430
We can do it.

20:09.120 --> 20:10.560
Prepare to launch!

20:12.300 --> 20:13.760
Prepare to launch!

20:13.760 --> 20:15.190
Disengage primary lock bolts!

20:16.730 --> 20:20.490
Disengage confirmed.
Disengaging the umbilical bridge.

20:22.480 --> 20:23.650
Disengage secondary lock bolts.

20:26.070 --> 20:28.330
Disengage primary restraints.

20:28.330 --> 20:30.410
Likewise, disengage secondary restraints.

20:34.040 --> 20:37.080
Release safety locks numbers
one through fifteen.

20:37.080 --> 20:38.460
Release confirmed.

20:38.460 --> 20:40.580
Currently, Unit 01's condition is free.

20:40.580 --> 20:42.350
Internal batteries fully charged.

20:42.350 --> 20:44.380
External battery outlet, normal.

20:44.380 --> 20:47.800
Roger. Move Eva Unit 01
to the ejector pad.

21:03.030 --> 21:05.200
Launch path is clear. All systems green.

21:05.200 --> 21:07.250
Ready for launch.

21:07.890 --> 21:08.660
Roger.

21:09.620 --> 21:11.010
Can we really do this?

21:11.010 --> 21:12.250
Of course.

21:12.800 --> 21:15.500
Unless we defeat the Angels,
we have no future.

21:16.950 --> 21:20.140
Ikari, you're really sure about this?

21:21.600 --> 21:22.460
Launch!

21:56.490 --> 21:58.790
Shinji, don't get killed out there.

21:58.830 --> 22:00.460
TO BE CONTINUED

23:05.900 --> 23:06.780
PREVIEW

23:06.370 --> 23:07.930
Eva triumphs over the Angel!

23:07.930 --> 23:10.280
However, that was just the beginning.

23:10.280 --> 23:12.220
Shinji runs away from his father.

23:12.220 --> 23:15.790
Misato's arrogance leads her
to try to save him.

23:15.790 --> 23:18.370
Next Evangelion: "Unfamiliar Ceiling"

23:18.090 --> 23:20.650
I'll give you fan service next time too!

23:18.830 --> 23:21.140
UNFAMILIAR CEILING
